    <briefdescription>
<para>Arithmetic engine for Hierarchical Tucker tensors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides O(d·r⁴) inner product without full tensor reconstruction.</para>
<para><heading level="3">Inner product algorithm (Grasedyck 2010 §4)</heading>
</para>
<para>Given two HT tensors A and B with the same binary-tree topology:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Leaf k: Γ_k[α, β] = ∑_i U_A_k[i, α] · U_B_k[i, β] (O(n·r²))</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Internal node (bottom-up): Γ[α, β] = ∑_{γ_l,γ_l&apos;,γ_r,γ_r&apos;} B_A[γ_l,γ_r,α] · B_B[γ_l&apos;,γ_r&apos;,β] · Γ_left[γ_l,γ_l&apos;] · Γ_right[γ_r,γ_r&apos;] (O(r⁴) per node)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Root: ⟨A, B⟩ = Γ_root[0, 0]</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Total: O(d·n·r² + d·r⁴). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
